OL,3,GNEWSABan school uniforms in porn, say
OL,4,Apupils
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We're not 'sexy schoolgirls'. We're
OL,7,Fnot objects. We're students, and more
OL,8,Fimportantly, children."
OL,10,FA group of teenage girls from
OL,11,FOxfordshire are calling on the
OL,12,Fgovernment to ban the use of school
OL,13,Funiform in pornography.
OL,15,FThe pupils, from The Cooper School in
OL,16,FBicester, have launched a petition
OL,17,Farguing that adult content featuring
OL,18,Fschool uniform is 'a clear example of
OL,19,Fmaterial that sexualises children and
OL,20,Fyoung people'.
