OL,3,GNEWSABan school uniforms in porn, say
OL,4,Apupils
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn April this year, the government
OL,7,Fagreed new legislation making it a
OL,8,Fcriminal offence to possess or share
OL,9,Fpornographic content featuring adults
OL,10,Fpretending to be under 16, as part of
OL,11,Fthe Crime and Policing Act 2026, but it
OL,12,Fhas yet to come into force.
